['globalarts','Metropolitan Museum of Art','Guinea Coast, 1600–1800','Museum historical overview','https://www.metmuseum.org/it/toah/ht/09/afg.html','Ọ̀yọ́ kingship, trade, Ṣàngó and Ògún in artistic history.']
